Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.56,0:01:29.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Which means... wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.77,0:01:33.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,They'll start dating?
