Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:45.25,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Sawako-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.66,0:01:47.87,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm really glad you're willing to help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.25,0:01:49.75,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:52.21,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, see you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:04.52,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.56,0:02:07.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,On second thought, I don't think I'll be able to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.27,0:02:08.14,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:12.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I don't think... I can do this...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:31.42,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I guess... I don't really suit Kazehaya, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:32.59,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:34.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,No, that's not what I meant!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.75,0:02:38.42,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Then I want you to support me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.76,0:02:43.30,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're the only one I've ever told this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:45.39,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.39,0:02:48.77,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you think there are other girls who would suit him better?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.85,0:02:53.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.15,0:02:57.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,No, I think you two are a great match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.61,0:03:00.61,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.61,0:03:01.61,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:06.70,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I can't really support you with all my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.70,0:03:08.66,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I won't be able to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.87,0:03:13.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like Kazehaya-kun is special to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:18.26,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm... really sorry I can't be of any use.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:22.84,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She was willing to share her feelings with me, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.26,0:03:25.89,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wish there was something else I could do for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.89,0:03:31.77,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-kun must be special to her, just like how he is to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:39.40,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Although I can't help you, I... I totally understand how you feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:41.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So... if you ever want to talk, I'll always be there to listen-
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:43.28,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You're so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:50.04,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Why won't you back off already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.58,0:03:55.88,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't this where you back off after\N understanding the difference between us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.42,0:03:59.67,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,The voice is coming from her direction...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:03.18,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is there someone talking behind her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:04.39,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:07.35,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean you "understand how I feel"?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:10.31,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to go out with Kazehaya or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.89,0:04:12.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:13.19,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't even dream of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.19,0:04:13.85,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.15,0:04:15.60,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Then what makes him "special" to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:16.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.44,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it because he was nice to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.44,0:04:19.57,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.90,0:04:21.36,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Or is it because he paid attention to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.94,0:04:23.86,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Or maybe because he was friendly to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:25.99,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,M-Maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:27.74,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's only because of his personality, isn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.70,0:04:33.00,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,So as long as someone's kind to you,\N it doesn't have to be Kazehaya, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.21,0:04:36.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kurumi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.84,0:04:40.63,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't fair, Sawako-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.38,0:04:42.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.80,0:04:46.14,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Just because others avoid you due to your gloomy look...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:49.05,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,...you don't even have to try to get Kazehaya's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.97,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:56.48,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Someone as pretty and popular as me has to work and earn his attention, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.74,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! K-Kurumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.49,0:05:08.24,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I-I didn't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:11.04,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,...it was so tough being popular...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:18.29,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And so, I was benefiting from looking gloomy...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.34,0:05:23.80,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,What! Just because you're cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.30,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.84,0:05:27.97,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,No, I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.97,0:05:31.72,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get all stuck-up just because\N you're a little cuter than other people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:33.72,Default,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's decided.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.98,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,You just don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.98,0:05:38.81,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That sounded similar to Kurumi-chan's advice...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.23,0:05:45.11,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't fair, Sawako-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.57,0:05:48.74,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't even have to try to get Kazehaya's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:51.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She's so right....
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.03,0:05:56.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I was just taking advantage of his generosity...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:06:02.21,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,So as long as someone's kind to you,\N it doesn't have to be Kazehaya, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.13,0:06:06.76,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-I wonder if she was right about that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:12.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So if someone other than Kazehaya-kun is nice to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.77,0:06:18.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Would I... have the same feelings I have now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.36,0:06:22.98,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,All right, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.44,0:06:25.28,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Today's the day we've been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.24,0:06:28.49,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,The day of the sports festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.78,0:06:30.41,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Approach it like your lives are on the line!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.41,0:06:31.20,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,That is all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.20,0:06:32.20,Default,Pin,0000,0000,0000,,Dismissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:33.74,Default,Every,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.79,0:06:38.33,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,How do I look in this red shirt?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.33,0:06:39.37,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Do I stand out?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.37,0:06:40.25,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You bet!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.25,0:06:41.38,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,You look like a champ!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:43.04,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,Your stupidity really stands out, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.04,0:06:44.50,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.50,0:06:45.92,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Gosh, you're making me blush!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.63,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! Yoshida-san looks so cool in red!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.30,0:06:52.89,Default,Ayako,0000,0000,0000,,She looks really happy about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.22,0:06:57.89,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, women's soccer plays before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:06:59.89,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go and cheer them on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.89,0:07:00.77,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:02.02,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:05.40,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You guys better not start heckling or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.40,0:07:07.03,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,We'll cheer for you. Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.03,0:07:08.57,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You can count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.57,0:07:10.24,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.45,0:07:13.91,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, that should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.54,0:07:19.12,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:21.17,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You look adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.62,0:07:22.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Really? You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.71,0:07:23.71,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.71,0:07:25.17,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,It really does!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.46,0:07:27.71,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,That's a much more refreshing look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.71,0:07:28.55,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.01,0:07:31.22,Default,Girl5,0000,0000,0000,,You look cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.19,0:07:48.11,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.74,0:07:56.37,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'd better do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.37,0:07:59.45,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, a good luck charm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.83,0:08:02.04,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Let me give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.63,0:08:06.63,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.63,0:08:07.54,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Me, three!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.54,0:08:08.38,Default,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky charm!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.71,0:08:11.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, I already feel like we can win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:12.34,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,We can!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:14.64,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,They're treating you like a fortune spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.64,0:08:16.80,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like you leveled up, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.80,0:08:19.64,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... I feel like I'm a part of the class!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:21.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's all thanks to Kazehaya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.73,0:08:33.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,These feelings I have for Kazehaya-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.20,0:08:35.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Did they come about because he's always helping me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.12,0:08:39.20,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,So... he's not really someone special?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.91,0:08:40.91,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,There she goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.20,Default,Girl2,0000,0000,0000,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.70,0:08:43.21,Default-alt,Girl3,0000,0000,0000,,I'm open!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:43.91,Default,Girl4,0000,0000,0000,,Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.79,0:08:47.88,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We're up 3-2 in stoppage time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.21,0:08:51.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if the girls can pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:52.51,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:54.88,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,Note: A "hattrick" means that one player scored three goals in one half.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:54.88,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,The Red Devil has already scored a hattrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:03.14,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Chizu-chan, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.14,0:09:04.81,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Do you really want to stand out that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:07.06,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a second, did Sadako disappear off somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:08.61,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,No, she's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.11,0:09:10.44,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't she, Ryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:11.65,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:13.61,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Oh! I just saw her!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.61,0:09:15.74,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? I think I lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:17.28,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,Is she teleporting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:21.33,Default,Guy4,0000,0000,0000,,But hey... don't you guys think Sadako\N fits in with the rest of the class nowadays?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.33,0:09:23.33,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm with you on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:28.75,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,It also seems she's gotten more cheery since she became friends with Yano and Yoshida.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:38.43,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Crap! There's no one over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:40.97,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,S-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:41.89,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,S-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.06,0:09:49.56,Default,All,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:52.11,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:09:59.36,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,She did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:01.87,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:05.16,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.29,0:10:10.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,H-Huh? Where did my shoe go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.09,0:10:16.47,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.47,0:10:18.76,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.84,0:10:22.43,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:23.81,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Leave the rest to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:38.95,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Nice shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:40.20,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,That's our fourth goal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:45.66,Default,Ref,0000,0000,0000,,Game set!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.79,0:10:48.62,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We won!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.62,0:10:51.04,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Great job, Sadako!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:53.46,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We make a great team!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:56.17,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.67,0:10:58.80,Default,Guys,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:05.06,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:09.06,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,This is the first time I've ever celebrated a victory with everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:09.85,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:22.28,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,This is the result of our practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.61,0:11:24.66,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Yay for practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.26,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.59,0:11:44.85,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We're going to find a place and\N hold a strategy meeting for the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.14,0:11:45.89,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sounds good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.81,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What, you guys are up next?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.23,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Yup. Softball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.89,0:11:53.94,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Do your best out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.02,0:11:54.27,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.61,0:11:56.98,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Hit a big one! And I mean a big one!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.98,0:11:58.11,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Your elbows hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.11,0:11:59.28,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Get fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.73,0:11:59.28,Default-alt,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Ou-
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.28,0:12:00.28,Default,chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.61,0:12:00.28,Default-alt,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.28,0:12:01.32,Default,chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Fired up, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.03,0:12:01.32,Default-alt,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Ouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.24,0:12:04.32,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.66,0:12:06.53,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:07.62,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,We'll win this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.20,0:12:11.46,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Good work, Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.46,0:12:12.79,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.79,0:12:15.00,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't you going to say something to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:17.21,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,I was the MVP!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.21,0:12:19.55,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You really stood out... being so red and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.55,0:12:21.67,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.05,0:12:25.72,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Okay... We need to go to volleyball practice now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:27.01,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:29.35,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Intense grinding before the actual match, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:32.10,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,There's still over an hour left before our match begins...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.10,0:12:33.98,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going to do until then, Sadako?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.98,0:12:37.86,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh... I guess for starters, I'll go look for my shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:39.98,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Where did you leave it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.98,0:12:42.53,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I put too much into that kick...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:46.11,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Then do you want to come see us practice after you find your shoe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.11,0:12:48.53,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,No, Sawako should go and support the men's softball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.12,0:12:52.66,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Since their time conflicts with ours...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.12,0:12:56.21,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,...could you go and cheer for them for us, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.17,0:12:58.13,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.46,0:12:59.42,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.42,0:13:01.00,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:02.88,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I'll come watch your volleyball game, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.18,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.80,0:13:07.26,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,You can count on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:09.68,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.81,0:13:12.39,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,You'd better not lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.48,0:13:14.39,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.85,0:13:17.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Lose what? A cheering war?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.28,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,What did you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.28,0:13:23.11,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,We already won the soccer game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.82,Default,Ayane,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.04,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.42,0:13:43.05,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.38,0:13:47.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,You found my shoe for me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.43,0:13:49.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I always knew you were nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.51,0:13:55.60,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look. Kurumi-chan went and found Sadako's shoe for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:57.94,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,She's such a nice girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.94,0:14:00.77,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go, Sawako-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.11,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.07,0:14:06.11,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What an angel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.11,0:14:07.78,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,She's so sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.82,0:14:09.66,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.66,0:14:10.70,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.70,0:14:11.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.62,0:14:13.62,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,About yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.62,0:14:16.75,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I think I was getting a little too conceited. I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:19.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kurumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.96,0:14:25.26,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you dare... call me that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:26.51,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.30,0:14:30.72,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,U-Ume-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:35.47,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, Sawako-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.47,0:14:42.69,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,...I've written your name down on my\N list of "People Who Have Called Me Ume".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.11,0:14:44.07,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.07,0:14:47.15,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,She wrote about me in her diary!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.15,0:14:50.41,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is that really okay? I'm flattered...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:52.78,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Would that be the normal reaction here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.20,0:14:55.20,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:57.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Ume-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.95,0:14:59.33,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't call me "Ume"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.08,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Th-Then what should I call you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.34,0:15:10.80,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,That name... is the only thing that makes me feel small.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.13,0:15:12.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,But it's such a cute name!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.34,0:15:13.76,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,How is it cute?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.76,0:15:16.64,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It's an old lady's name that was given to me by my grandmother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.60,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't suit me at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.60,0:15:20.10,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,An old lady's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:22.31,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I think it sounds cute, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.31,0:15:23.90,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,But it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.90,0:15:26.73,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well... I'm Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.73,0:15:27.86,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,No, you're Sawako!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.49,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,That's a wonderful name.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.03,0:15:39.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Now that I think about it, she's always called me Sawako-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:44.71,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Hey... if you don't mind, do you want to walk to the field with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.71,0:15:47.42,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Why should I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:49.30,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There's going to be a match soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.30,0:15:51.17,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-kun will be playing in it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.80,0:15:53.01,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.26,0:15:57.64,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Of...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.47,0:16:01.14,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Of course I'm going to go watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.56,0:16:06.36,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,My impression of her has somewhat changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.77,0:16:08.98,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,...but she's still adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.98,0:16:10.07,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,So, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.57,0:16:14.03,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Why do I have to watch the game with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:14.03,Default-alt,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! Kurumi-chan is going to watch us play!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.03,0:16:15.95,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Why are you whispering?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:15.95,Default-alt,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Let's call her name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.32,0:16:17.58,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.66,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I have my reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.66,0:16:22.66,Default,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Hey! Kurumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.66,0:16:27.42,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,When I'm with you, I always get\N irritated and end up revealing my true self.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:31.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind... My impression of her has {\i1}really{\i0\fscx30} {\r} changed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:35.09,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I guess she's more open about her feelings with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.09,0:16:36.14,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.14,0:16:37.35,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:41.43,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,We'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.41,0:17:03.33,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow! He's waving at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:05.17,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.87,0:17:09.38,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh... He was waving at Kurumi-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:10.92,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That makes sense...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,There are a lot of girls watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.22,0:17:15.97,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Who's that girl next to Sadako again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.97,0:17:17.34,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That's Kurumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.34,0:17:19.22,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't she cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:21.56,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,Speaking of Sadako, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:25.64,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,After closely watching her play soccer, I've come to realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.98,0:17:27.73,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She's really frightening!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:28.36,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.36,0:17:29.40,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,She leaves afterimages!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.19,0:17:31.53,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I have so much more respect for her now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:33.07,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Sadako is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.07,Default,Guy3,0000,0000,0000,,Agreed!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:37.07,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Are they... praising her?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.24,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,I guess that's good, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.24,0:17:43.12,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,But wait... Her name isn't actually "Sadako", right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:44.83,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,What? Isn't that her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.83,0:17:46.00,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kuronuma Sadako.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.37,0:17:50.59,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,No... Chizuru made me memorize it the other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:53.00,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,If I recall...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:54.38,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Taka...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.38,0:17:56.22,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,Got nothing to do with "Takako"!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:58.13,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I could have sworn I figured out a way to remember it...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.13,0:18:01.05,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,It was a scene of a dark, dreary water...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.05,0:18:02.26,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,"Numa"...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.85,0:18:05.77,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,"Start" begins with an "S", right? Her name also starts with an "S"!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.23,0:18:07.10,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Sakako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:07.89,Default,Chizu,0000,0000,0000,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.77,0:18:11.27,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,That's right... It begins with an "S", and...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.27,0:18:12.69,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,What comes next...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:15.19,Note,,0000,0000,0000,,Note: A "tawashi" is a scrub.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.69,0:18:15.19,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,I'm thinking of a tawashi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.19,0:18:17.11,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sawashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.24,0:18:19.07,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.28,0:18:23.08,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Kuranuma Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:25.04,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.75,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, was it Doronuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.75,0:18:28.71,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,No, dude... It's Kuronuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.71,0:18:31.21,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, shouldn't we play catch to warm up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.21,0:18:32.79,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:35.13,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Let's do it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.59,0:18:37.97,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,You want to pair up, Shota?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.13,0:18:39.72,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:43.18,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Sawako.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:54.23,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I... looked up the word, "special", in my dictionary last night...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:55.98,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What? A dictionary?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.40,0:19:01.87,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It said something about a person\N you can't treat the same as others...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.82,0:19:05.08,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Dictionaries are amazing, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.08,0:19:07.54,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's almost like it overheard our conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.54,0:19:09.25,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.17,0:19:11.83,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,H-How should I put it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.83,0:19:13.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.96,0:19:20.22,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,In other words, I used to think of Kazehaya-kun that way...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.80,0:19:25.43,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's true he's always helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.39,0:19:30.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,It's always him helping me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:36.94,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,And I can't compare him with anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.36,0:19:42.74,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't that because you haven't really spoken to other guys before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.78,0:19:46.12,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you go talk to some of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.12,0:19:49.50,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't there any guys who sit near you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:51.58,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Kazehaya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.58,0:19:52.83,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, someone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.71,0:19:54.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Someone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.46,0:19:57.09,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Say, someone who sits behind you or in front of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.09,0:19:58.21,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Behind me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.63,0:20:00.34,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Sanada-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:03.84,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,I've had occasional conversations with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:05.93,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Sanada?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.97,0:20:08.01,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.01,0:20:10.93,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Take this special curve ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.93,0:20:11.60,Default-alt,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.44,0:20:13.06,Default,Kaze,0000,0000,0000,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.91,0:20:30.95,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Nice cover, Ryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:32.50,Default,Ryu,0000,0000,0000,,Stick to fastballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.96,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:37.46,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,That scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:39.63,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.63,0:20:41.59,Default,Guy2,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! I really am!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:40.96,Default-alt,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.38,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,He saved you, didn't he.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.59,0:20:45.68,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.68,0:20:50.27,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I have to thank him! I was just at a loss for words!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:54.35,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you really ought to thank him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.77,0:20:57.44,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't you try talking with Sanada more often?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.73,0:20:58.48,Default,Sawako,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:20:59.90,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.19,Default,Kurumi,0000,0000,0000,,Just the two of you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.96,0:21:25.93,Kimi_no_Todoke_ED1-RO,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}{\kf54}So{\kf43}no {\kf44}so{\kf30}ra {\kf21}i{\kf17}p{\kf26}pa{\kf31}i {\kf22}no {\kf41}ka{\kf21}mi{\kf38}hi{\kf46}ko{\kf41}u{\kf45}ki{\kf37} {\kf49}gu{\kf49}ra{\kf26}i {\kf41}ni {\kf62}na{\kf21}t{\kf252}te{\kf40}
